      "message": "[`panic_get_reason()` is implemented with a call to `panic_get_data()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/release-firmware/fpmcu-dartmonkey/ec/core/cortex-m/panic.c;l\u003d509-522;drc\u003d022c5e9e85bf73a0dbbb16d62710d49650feda1c).\n\nThere is some additional information that can be [stored in panic_data like file name, line number and flags](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/test/panic_data.c;l\u003d23-61;drc\u003d91a867ceb8a290476d29e60f9a21cc22cc765195), but [file name and line number are only set for `software_panic`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/panic_output.c;l\u003d135-149;drc\u003d86c39f0b42d4d919583b59c1e44d7f5aa50e147d), and not in the [watchdog handler](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/core/cortex-m/watchdog.c;l\u003d37-48;drc\u003d72b89b499b7b785709f35518b1192ee9d71d05f9).",
